299
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,280
The first week,

300
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:04,120
I couldn't have told

301
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,780
you if anything was
happening.

302
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:06,700
I tried not to get

303
