342
00:09:02,860 --> 00:09:03,640
Three.

343
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:05,510
There's only so much room
in there.

344
00:09:05,510 --> 00:09:06,840
Bending compresses it.

345
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,420
Straightening pulls it
tight.

346
00:09:08,420 --> 00:09:09,790
That's the squeeze.

347
00:09:10,340 --> 00:09:11,240
Four.

348
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:13,130
Red and near-infrared
light have been

349
00:09:13,130 --> 00:09:15,260
studied for calming that
inflammation,

350
00:09:15,260 --> 00:09:16,530
so the swelling and the
pressure

351
00:09:16,530 --> 00:09:17,820
can come down with it.

352
00:09:17,820 --> 00:09:19,330
In a randomized trial,

353
00:09:19,330 --> 00:09:21,150
patients given light
therapy after

354
00:09:21,150 --> 00:09:22,220
a knee replacement

355
00:09:22,220 --> 00:09:23,440
had less pain,

356
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,480
less swelling

357
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:26,190
and better early movement
than

358
00:09:26,190 --> 00:09:27,480
those who weren't.

359
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:30,260
A 2025 review said the
same,

360
00:09:30,260 --> 00:09:31,470
and was clear the evidence

361
00:09:31,470 --> 00:09:32,820
is still limited.

362
00:09:32,820 --> 00:09:34,140
I probably sound like a
broken

363
00:09:34,140 --> 00:09:35,820
record to my customers.

364
00:09:35,820 --> 00:09:38,090
But after two years of
doing everything

365
00:09:38,090 --> 00:09:40,220
I was told and getting
nowhere,

366
00:09:40,220 --> 00:09:41,620
you have no idea what it's

367
00:09:41,620 --> 00:09:43,250
like to sleep through the
night,

368
00:09:43,250 --> 00:09:44,700
say yes to the walk,

369
00:09:44,700 --> 00:09:46,220
and get my life back.

370
00:09:46,220 --> 00:09:48,080
So take it from me.

371
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,510
Don't spend another year
waiting

372
00:09:49,510 --> 00:09:50,710
